    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal would be within the tolerances of Schedule 2, Part 1 Classes A, B, C\r\nand D of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development)\r\n(England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposed change of use of the existing dwellinghouse to a small house in\r\nmultiple occupation falls within the parameters of permitted development as set\r\nout under Schedule 2, Part 3, Class L of the Town and Country Planning (General\r\nPermitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
